OL,3,GNEWSAHow is the hosepipe ban changing
OL,4,Ain Sussex?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn expanded hosepipe ban has come into
OL,7,Fforce for South East Water customers
OL,8,Facross Sussex.
OL,10,FThe supplier first introduced
OL,11,Frestrictions to the area in July.
OL,13,FMultiple exemptions to the ban have
OL,14,Fbeen removed - effective from 9 October
OL,15,F- while an application for restrictions
OL,16,Faffecting businesses remains pending.
OL,18,FThe households affected by the change
OL,19,Fare South East Water customers in
OL,20,FSussex.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
